        "content": "Jul 15. 2025 Analogue 3D - Shipping Next Month Following last week’s sudden tariff changes, Analogue 3D will now begin shipping next month. We’re absorbing the costs—your preorder price stays the same. No additional charges. read more Mar 18. 2025 Analogue 3D Shipping by July 2025, Pocket White Restock, Pocket OS and Duo OS Firmware Updates Analogue 3D shipping is delayed and is now shipping by July 2025. Analogue Pocket [white] is back in stock and shipping. read more Oct 16. 2024 Analogue OS is now product-specific: Pocket OS , Duo OS , 3D OS Analogue OS is now product-specific: Pocket OS for Pocket, Duo OS for Duo, 3D OS for 3D read more Sep 10. 2024 Analogue Pocket GBC Colors Limited Editions, Regular Editions Back In Stock, OS 2.3 Release An homage to the iconic original GBC Colors. Color matched. On sale September 12th 8am PDT and shipping September 16th. Released in limited quantities.",
